@page "/"

<PageTitle>BlazeDb lazy loading sample</PageTitle>

<h1>Lazy loading</h1>

<p>
    This page keeps no rows, so the browser has not downloaded <code>Bit.BlazeDb.wasm</code>. Open the
    <a href="todos">todos</a>: the router downloads it first, then the page opens the tab's database.
</p>
